<title>JAPAN: BOJ Governor Matsushita to attend BIS meeting.</title>
<headline>BOJ Governor Matsushita to attend BIS meeting.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will attend a monthly meeting of the Bank for International Settlements (BIS) to be held next week in Basle, Switzerland, the BOJ said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Matsushita will leave Japan on July 5 and return on July 9.</p>
</text>
